"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T20:01:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T20:01:25Z","body":"I'll investigate this next week.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5859348331/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6006243869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123878#issuecomment-6006243869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123878","id":6006243869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZgACHQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T00:15:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T00:15:38Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.8.dev7 (Linux), but only with official builds. A local self-compiled build doesn't reproduce the issue with my default development profile.\n\nSCons options used for the self-compiled build:\n\n```\nscons -j32 scu_build=all linkflags='-fuse-ld=wild' platform=linuxbsd optimize=none debug_symbols=yes fast_unsafe=yes builtin_embree=yes builtin_enet=no builtin_freetype=no builtin_graphite=no builtin_harfbuzz=yes builtin_libogg=yes builtin_libpng=no builtin_libtheora=yes builtin_libvorbis=yes builtin_libwebp=no builtin_mbedtls=no builtin_miniupnpc=no builtin_pcre2=no builtin_zlib=no builtin_zstd=no builtin_sdl=yes tests=no module_text_server_adv_enabled=yes module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes builtin_ogg=no builtin_opus=no tests=no accesskit=no\n```\n\nIt turns out whether the issue occurs depends on the compiler optimization level:\n\nOptimization level | Bug occurs\n-|-\n`speed` | **Yes**\n`speed_trace` | **Yes**\n`size` | **Yes**\n`size_extra` | **Yes**\n`debug` | No\n`none` | No\n\nI figured out it's due to uninitialized variables: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124207","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6006243869/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]